<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="h">ROM - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">ROM - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">ROM - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">ROM - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROM - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROMAWA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Icɛr yiŋɛ ire bǝn nga Bulus, igen ayou Kristi Yesɔ ne zeu ndi Arik ne hriam te zhɔm te mbǝ na ndum kɛ du lɛ didik kɛ Arik.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Ilɛ didik keŋ ndi Arik ne amene kpa kɛ aŋyak ne anu akɛ ne du lɛ maa nkanlɛ maa yi tsetser. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Ilɛ didik kǝŋe iyi netu akɛ Izu maa, Ngɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi amɔr: Ne zi tu maa, ne ŋliu ne nga kɛ Doda; <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />ndi Arik ne yaŋ lalɛ, ne tsa ru mgbyamgbyaŋ maa kɛ Izu Arik ne lu maa Yesɔ Kristi ne bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Nǝ tu kɛ Kristi, Arik ne na didik maa ne nǝm mkpaŋ te duŋ mbǝ yi izhiin ne abɛ na ndum maa ne sak kɛ kristi, te mgli aneshir abɛ gɔŋmimi te vuŋ abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba abɛ tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ Arik te na zǝ kɛ <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Neme iyiŋɛ ne duŋ azhi izhin abɛ yi ne Roma, abaŋ ndi Arik ne zhɔzhin abɛ zǝ Yesɔ Kristi.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Fena nga Bulus Mcɛr zhin aner abɛ Roma abaŋ ndi Arik anyɛr zhin tena zhɔzhin te zhin bǝ yi aner amaa:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Duŋ Arik Tetɛɛ amɔr ben Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ kristi bɛ nek zhin ita zhɔk ben sik susun.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iben yi nyɛr Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Nǝ kuti, me nyɛr Arik amuŋ ize ben Yesɔ Kristi netu min bɔbɔk, te aner abɛ gɔŋmimi azǝn wɔ tanyɛmɛ min. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Arik ne zhi iki yiŋ ndi mblai ai lɛ didik; Arik waŋ ndi mzekuru ne susun muŋ te na du lɛ kɛ men kɛ Yesɔ Izu maa. Arik ne zhi me shuzhin zhin <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ mben Arik amuŋ. Mǝ mben Arik te ndi ne miŋ kɛ kiki didik yi na maa abɛ nǝm mkpaŋ kɛ gar ben abɛ zhin. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Tǝm te izhɔŋ yi yik zhin, tem bla zhin kiki yi nek izhu tsetser te zhin bǝ klik. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Iki yiŋ ndi yi ne susun muŋ izhineba ben nga Bulus abɛ lɛk ta mkpaŋ zhin, ne tanyɛme min ben muŋ.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Izhin bǝ shuzhi, amunya, me lǝlɛ kɛ gar bǝn abɛ zhin mkpaŋ tetɛk, ama kiki nuŋ yar mma, ir keŋ ndi mne na bǝn abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Tǝ ihru kɛ abɛ yi Mgbemgbeb bǝn abaŋ ndi ayi abliblik, ben abɛ zhi ki bǝn abɛ yaŋ zhi ki <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ne me, Mǝ yaŋ susun kɛ du ilɛ kɛ men ben zhineba ndi zhin yi ne Roma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ lɛ didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Mǝ yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ du lɛ kɛ Arik; ayi mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik ben abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛme, ne kuti Yahudawa fe ben abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Fe ilɛ kɛ men kǝŋe tsar aneshir ankɔŋ ane tɔ shak ayi ne ti kɛ Arik: ai ankɔŋɔ ane tanyɛme ibaŋ rɛ kuti te gar klɛtu. Ir keŋ ndi lɛ kɛ Arik ne di &lt;&lt;Iner ne tsǝn anenen ben Arik ne tanyɛme atei lieru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilalɛ ye aneshir bɔbɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Mfu kɛ Arik ne rurɛ shu, te zhaku ne atu aneshir abɛ lalɛ ben zumimin te atsi lɛ didik kɛ Arik aku ne zumimin men. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Ndi iyeme Arik asak ba iyah, te neka zhi ilɛ kɛ Arik ire kukub, Arik ne tu maa ne bla ba. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Nak men rǝ mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Arik ne na gɔŋmimi, kiki yi na maa ne naŋ zhi, a yik Arik bɔbɔk ne kiki yi na maa ne me aneshir abɛ na kiki iyiŋɛ ba tei lieru ba! <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Ne zhi Arik, ama ba nǝgu ŋgɔŋ maa ba, ba na nye ru ba. Ndi amɛ, izhu yi asusun mǝne ayi isha, asusun amene akɔkur sha zumimin ne shak asusun. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Ne me atsar te aba yi abɛ zhi, ama ayi kpukpur; <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Ndi ai bɛ zǝ Arik waŋ ndi ba ku te abɔ ba, akyak te kama zǝ kiki yi na aneshir ben aŋliŋlɔ, inarum ye abɛm, bǝn inarum yi gbur ne mimi.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Fe Arik ne duŋ abɛ na kiki yi te bubu ne asusun amen, te na kiki yi shisha ne akpa men. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ne sen lɛ didik kɛ Arik netu ayi timu; te kama zekur iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nai te duŋ waŋ ndi ne na gɔŋmimi me, iwa nɛrɛ te abɛ zikuru mla ne klɛ tu! Bǝ yi amɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ama nena ki yiŋɛ, Arik ne duŋ ba nena kiki shisha men. Tǝ vuŋ mbǝmba men ne duŋ kur ben alulum amen te kama kur ne akpa men. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa alulum ne duŋɔ ankɔŋ ane kur ben amba te kam akur ne akpa men. Alulum nena ki yi shisha ne akpa men ki yi na mǝne ne duŋ asak ba iyah ne ki yiŋ ndi ne nai.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Ndi aneshire abaŋa ne kyak tanyɛme ne lɛ kɛ Arik ne asusun amen, Arik ne nek ba susun kɛ na ki mimin, te abɛ na ki yiŋ ndi ba ne rɛ abɛ nai ba. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Asusun amene ne shaga ne kiki mimin, zumimin, ite bubu, ina ki mimin, iruk abɛm, iŋlɔk aneshir, ite antam, ishɔk mgbu, ilɔm aner. Te ter <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />te lɛ kiki mimin ne akpa men; ba ne tanyɛme bǝn Arik ba, abɛ na zumimin, abɛ klik atu, abɛ tei atetɛ men mla; <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />abaŋ ndi bane zhi ki ba; ba zǝ lɛ bla men ba, ba na ki didik bǝn lɔ susun yi anuŋ ba. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Ne zhi te lɛ kɛ Arik ne di anere abaŋ ndi ana kiki yiŋɛ ne mla te abɛ ku. Neme bane nai ankyak ba ayi ne miŋ kɛ nai ma, ama azǝn bla te di anuŋ anai.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ite ŋas yi Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Fena, izhineba akpaamuŋ, izhin te anuŋ ambuk? Ba zhin yine kinuŋ yi na ba, ka uyi ŋɔwa. A te yi ndi uzǝn te anuŋ ambuk te na zen na ki yiŋ ndi anai ma, uzǝn te tu mi ambuk. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Ta ne zhi te ayi Arik wa ankyak atei te aneshir abɛ na kiki yiŋɛ ambuk. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ama uwa, ikpa muŋ, ndi uzǝn na kiki yiŋɛ te kam zen te anuŋ ambuk! Uyik utei lieru ne ambuk aye Arik? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />kɔ kau tsǝn kiki yi na maa, ben vuŋ kpa maa, ben vuŋ susun maa, Une zhi ayi ner didik, awɔb te wa abɛ tsa ru ankɔŋ ane ben te lieru.<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ama une kpa susun mi yaŋ nek tu, uduŋ iyah mi itei yi ngɔŋ ne bɛr yi te mfu ben te ambuk tsetser yi Arik atei gli arumɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Fe Arik atei nek kɔte ŋɔwa idǝk maa anenen ne ndum maa. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Aneshir azǝn na kiki didik yi gbar, ben wɔb ngɔŋ, te wɔb ikpa kɛ yaŋ be; Arik atei nek ba vli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Aneshir anuŋ anyɛr akpa men te kyak na ki yiŋ ndi yi anenen, te aba bǝ zǝ ki yiŋ ndi ba yi anenen ba; Arik atei te mfu ngɔŋ ben rǝra ne atu mǝne. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Abaŋ ndi ne na zumimin atei yik iyah ben lɛn kpa,Yahudawa atei kuti fe abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba akɔ zǝ. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ama Arik atei nek ngɔŋ ben sik susun ne atu abɛ na ki didik, Yahudawa atei kuti fe abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Fe Arik atei te kɔte ŋɔwa ŋas anenen ne iki yi na maa.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba, bane yik cɛr yi Musa ba te lalɛ; atei na te ba ambuk ne yaŋ yik cɛr yi Musa. Yahudawa a yi ne cɛr yi Musa; te lalɛ atei na te ba ambuk ne cɛr yi Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Fe ba yi abaŋ ndi awɔ lɛ kɛ cɛr yi Musa Arik atei tanyɛme ben abɛba ba, ama aye abaŋ ndi ana ki yiŋ ndi yi ne cɛr yi Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ate yiŋ ndi abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba ba yi ne cɛr yi Musa ba; ama ate yi ndi asusun amen ne nek ba abɛ na ki yiŋ ndi cɛr yi Musa ne bla, ndi ba yime neyi ba ana na me. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Kiki yi na mǝne ne duŋ azhi te cɛr yi Musa iyi ne asusun amen. Ibaŋ asusun mǝne tena duŋ kiki yi na mǝne yi didik, ilɛ kɛ asusun mǝne na bla ba kiki mimin yiŋ ndi anai mkpaŋ nuŋ ina duŋ ba alieru. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Fe, ilɛ kɛ men keŋ ndi Mzǝn du kɛ, waŋai ir keŋ ndi yime ne bɛr ndi Arik atei duŋ Yesɔ Kristi anyɛ te ambuk ne kiki iyi suyir ndi anai.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudawa ben cɛr yi Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Tǝ iwa fa? udi uyi ŋli Yahudawa; une ta nyɛmɛ ne cɛr Musa te na ŋur asa ne zhi Arik; <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />une nazhi ki yiŋ ndi Arik awɔb te ubǝ nai, te nazhi iki yiŋ ndi icɛr yi Musa ne di abɛ nai anenen; <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Une zhi te uyi ne tsar aner abɛ amfik ankɔŋ, te na yi laŋ ben abaŋ ndi ayi ne buu, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />u na yi ne tsar abɛ yi kpukpur, u na yi ne tsar abaŋ ndi ba ne zhi ikinuŋ ba. Une zhi lɛ didik keŋ ndi yi ne cɛr yi Musa <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Utsar anuŋ aye nii duŋ bau ne zhi tsar tu mi kai? Udu lɛ te di,&lt;&lt;Duŋ zhib zhin ba&gt;&gt;ama uwa tu mi bau zhib kai? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Udi,&lt;&lt;Duŋ wɔb amba ba&gt;&gt; ama uwa tu mi bau zǝ amba kai? Ushi abɛ zǝ anerim ama bau zhib ne akabaŋkɔŋ kai? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Uwa ndi uŋur asa te di une zhi cɛr yi Musa ama ndi kau nek Arik shisha ne zi ki yiŋ ndi iyi ne miŋ cɛr yi Musa ka? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di, &lt;&lt;Nǝ yi ne atu amin Yahudawa, abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba ne bla lǝlɛ mimin ne atu aye Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Ate yi ndi izhin zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik ben cɛr Musa, ikɔk zǝk min ishak ayi; ama izhin te kyak zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik, izhin tei yi ndi ba ne kɔk zhin zǝk ba. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Ate yi waŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba, waŋ ndi ba ne kɔgu zǝk ba, azǝ cɛr yi Musa Arik ba tei tɔu shak ayi ne yaŋ kɔk zǝk maa kai? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Fena izhineba Yahudawa a tei nek zhin shisha ne ti kɛ abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba ne yaŋ zǝ icɛr iyi Musa, izhin yi ne cɛr iyi Musa nena kɔk zhin zǝk; ama ba zhin ne zǝ ki yiŋ ndi icɛr iyi Musa ne di ba, ndi yeme ba ne kɔk ba zǝk ir kɛ kpa ba. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Nǝ klɛtu bɔbɔk, iŋɔwa ayi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa, ne kɔk zǝk yi min susun? Ba yi ner waŋ ndi ayi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ne bem ba ai waŋ ndi ne kɔgu zǝk kɛ kpa ba. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Neme iwaŋ ndi ayi awɔnǝ Yahudawa ne susun ai wa ayi awɔnǝ Yahudawa, kɔk zǝk yi susun ai yi iyi kɔk zǝk didik waŋa ai ndum kɛ Arik ben Izhu tsetser maa, bai cɛr iye aŋɔk ba. Ir neshir waŋa ai ta gbar ben Arik, ba ben neshir ba.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Fe ane Yahudawa ayi ne iki ndi te aba anaŋ abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa kai? Ka ikinuŋ didik iyi ne ine kɔk zǝk i? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Fena, ne kɔte ankɔŋ atawa! Nǝ kuti, Arik ne nek Yahudawa lɛ maa. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ama ate yiŋ ndi tetɛk ne miŋ mǝne ba na ki didik ba fa? Iyiŋɛ duŋ Arik bai na ki didik kai? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ɔɔ bai yi amɛ ba kɔ watsɔb! Arik ana ki anenen, kɔ ndi aneshir abɛ gɔŋmimi bɔbɔk ayi abɛ timu, ir keŋ ndi lɛ kɛ Arik ne bla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">&lt;&lt;Ilɛ mi bǝ duŋ ayik ina didik mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">Utei lieru ndi ate tsar kiki yi na mi atɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Atei ndi ina mimin mɔr ai yi duŋ ayik didik kɛ Arik? Ta tei di Arik bane nek ta didik ka ndi ate sak ta iyah? (Waŋa ayi rib yiŋ ndi me tei rib zhin.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 3:5">Ɔɔ kɔ watsɔb! Ate yiŋ ndi iyi amɛ ben Arik, ai na kikin te te gɔŋmimi ŋas?<verse eid="ROM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Ama atei ndi imu muŋ iduŋ ayik ngɔŋ kɛ Arik tena duŋ ayik iklɛ lɛ kɛ Arik ndendei? Ayi anii duŋ zhin yik me yi ne la lɛ? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Anii duŋ izhin kyak di, te, &lt;&lt;Duŋ ta bǝ na zumimin te ki didik bǝ munru kai?&gt;&gt; Aneshir tetɛk, ayen me tena bla kiki mimin ne atu amuŋ te di mne blai! Arik atei nek ba shisha, ir keŋ ndi ayime.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ine yi tsetser ba yime ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Fena, taba Yahudawa tayi ne ankɔŋ anuŋ ane naŋ abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa kai? Ɔɔ kɔ watsɔb! Mne men bla Yahudawa ben abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba te zumimin iyi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne atu men ir keŋ ndi bɔbɔk mǝne akɔ sɔŋ ne angus ayi mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ zumimin. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Ir keŋ ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik idi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">&lt;&lt;Inuŋ ba yi tsetser ba,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Inuŋ bane zhi ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Inuŋ ba zǝ Arik ba<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Bɔbɔk mǝne ne kam goŋ anǝk Arik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Bɔbɔk mǝne ne tsǝn acɔk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Iner nena iki didik ba yime ba, kɔ ner zhiin.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Ililɛ mǝne iyi ndi ikum keŋ ndi ne bɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">Lǝlɛ mimin nak ru ne alǝlɛn amene ndi itus,<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Ilɛ mǝne ilɛk ben nek anu amimin.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Anama atur nkan lǝlɛ tena ŋun neshir;<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Amkpa waŋ ndi agaru ayi ne miŋ kɛ mfu ben la kiki.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Ba ne zhi amkpa ane nek sik susun ba,<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Kɔka abɛ yaŋ klu sǝsǝk Arik ne kiki yi na mǝne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Azizaŋa ta zhi te kɔte nii ne cɛr yi Musa iyi ne atu yi abaŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ ne angus icɛre, te aneshir bɔbɔk batei yi ne kam ilɛ nuŋ ba ne bɛr yiŋ ndi Arik atei te gɔŋmimi ŋas ba. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ndi amɛ inuŋ ba tsǝn anenen ne ti kɛ Arik ne kiki yiŋ ndi iyi ne cɛr iyi Musa ba; icɛr yi Musa yiŋɛ iyi duŋ ta zhi ilalɛ mɔr.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ir keŋ ndi Arik aduŋ ta yi anenen ne ti maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ama azizaŋa nkunkɔŋ yiŋ ndi Arik agli aneshir anyɛ ikpa maa ne gliu arumɔ. Icɛr yi Musa ben abɛ na ndum Arik ne tanyɛme ne ilɛmɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Arik mtanyeme ben aneshir ne tanyɛme men ben Yesɔ kristi. Arik ana yiŋɛ bɔbɔk ben abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛme ben kristi, te ikinuŋ bane gab ta kaaŋkaŋ ba: <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Bɔbɔk mɔrɔ tane lalɛ tena te shaan ne ti kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Ama ne nek ita zhɔk iye Arik tane lieru bene bɔu ne miŋ kɛ Yesɔ, Uwa ne ta ba shur. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Arik ne baŋu anǝk, te azhizhi amaa abɛ yi ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi ne zuk aneshir ashur ne lalɛ men te lieru ne tanyɛmɛ men. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Arik ne baŋu atsik ibaŋa, te duŋ ihrie azhizhi amaa ne yi ankɔŋ ane zuk aneshir ashur ne lalɛ ndi ne tanyɛme bene bɔu. Arik nena amɛ te Uwa abɛ tsar ngɔŋ maa tǝ wa ayi tsetser. Nǝ mkpaŋ kɛ gayir ne vuŋ susun te tɔ aneshir ndi ba yik ilalɛ mǝne ba, ama azizaŋa atei tsar tu maa te nek kɔte ŋɔwa iki yi na ndi ne tanyɛme ben Yesɔ.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Anii, fe, tǝ ta ŋur asa i? bai ki nuŋ ba! Fe aye nii duŋ ta na amei? Tǝ ta zǝ cɛr yi Musa i? Ɔɔ, te tane tanyɛme. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Neme ta ne zhi te di atsar ner ankɔŋ ane zǝ Arik ankyak ne tanyɛme, bai zǝ cɛr yi Musa ba. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ka Arik ayi Arik ane Yahudawa ankyak ni? Di ana yi Arik ane abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa menyi o? Bai ki tun ba, iyi amɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Arik ayi zhiin, atei na ta Yahudawa azhɔk ne tanyɛme men, atei na ta abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba azhɔk ne tanyɛme men. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Itanyɛme yiŋɛ iduŋ ta te tyak cɛr yi Musa zhɔk i? Ɔɔ, kɔ watsɔb; ne yiŋɛ, icɛr yi Musa inǝk mgbamgbaŋ maayi.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Zǝ nkɔŋ kɛ Ibrai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Ta tei di kikin, ne yiŋɛ, Ibrai, ntsǝntsǝm ayou atsintsim amɔr? Ayi anii ne yigǝ? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ate yi ndi Arik ne ta Ibrai ne iki didik iyi na maa, abɛ yi ne iki ŋur asa amaa ba ne ti kɛ Arik ba. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di, &lt;&lt;Ibrai ne tanyɛme ben Arik, fe ne tanyɛme maa Arik ne tau te ai nɛr tsetser.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Aner abaŋ ndi ana ndum aya ba idǝk men, ama bai tɔ ba ndi ne dik kɛ anek ba isha ba; ayi ne ki yiŋ ndi nena te atakǝ. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ama abaŋ ndi ne zhik ne tanyɛmɛ men, bane iki iyi na men ba, tena tanyɛme ben Arik awaŋ ndi abɛ te sǝsǝk ayi bǝ yaŋ zhi, ai tanyɛme yi Arik atɔi te duŋ neshir ayi ne angus amaa. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi Doda ne lɛ tedi iner waŋ ndi Arik ne tanyɛmɛ bene bɔu ne nyer maa, ama bai ndum kɛ na maa ba:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />&lt;&lt;Nyer iyi ben abaŋ ndi ne zuk ba shur ne lalɛ men,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">Abaŋ ndi bane gli ba ne lalɛ men ba!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Nyɛr iyi ne atu yi waŋ ndi Arik ba tei kpa lalɛ maa aŋyak ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Kiki yiŋ ndi Doda ne lɛ ma ne atu abaŋ ndi ne kɔk ba zǝk akyak gǝ? Ɔɔ! Inayi aner abaŋ ndi bane kɔk ba zǝk ba. Tǝ tane yik ne cɛr ilɛ kɛ Arik, Ibrai ne tanyɛme ben Arik, netu ayi tanyɛme maa Arik ne tau ne tsetser maa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Iki yiŋɛ ne yi atentai? Nǝ yi gɔŋ keŋ ndi ne kɔk Ibrai zǝk yi? Nǝ kuti, ba neyi gɔŋ maa ba. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ne kɔgu zǝk ne gɔŋ kɛ tanyɛmɛ maa, ikɔk zǝk maa ne duŋ Arik atau ne tanyɛmɛ maa teshe kɔgu zǝk. Ankyak Ibrai ne yi tetɛɛ ayou abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn Arik, ndi bane kɔk ba zǝk ba. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Ana yi tetɛɛ ben abɛ kɔk zǝk, na yi ben abaŋ ndi ne kɔk ba zǝk, fena, ben abaŋ ndi, te na zǝ ankɔŋɔ zhiin ben abɛ tanyɛme yi tetɛɛ Ibrai ne yime te shi kɔgu zǝk.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Ndi Arik ne kpa aŋyak Ibrai ben nga maa tedi gɔŋmimi tei yi maa, nena amɛ, bane yi netu yiŋ ndi Ibrai ne zǝ kpa nyak maa ba, ama ne yi ne atu yi tanyɛme te duŋ Arik ne tau ne tsetser maa. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Fe ate yi ndi ikpa nyak aye Arik iyi nek abaŋ ndi azǝ kpa nyak maa, ankyak itanyɛme ba yi kinuŋ ba fe ilɛ maa ba na yi ikinuŋ ba. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Fe Icɛr Musa igli mfu kɛ Arik nyɛmɛ; ama amkpa waŋ ndi Icɛr yi Musa ba yime ba ilalɛ ba yime ba, yaŋ zǝ cɛr yi Musa ba yime ba.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Ankyak ikpa nyak iyi ne miŋ kɛ tanyɛme, te abɛ duŋ kpa nyak bǝ yi ankɔŋ ne ta iki didik yi Arik te gar nŋli kɛ Ibrai ba yi abaŋ ndi azǝ icɛr yi Musa ankyak ba, ama iyi abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛme ne susun ir keŋ ndi Ibrai nena. Tǝ Ibrai wa ne yi tetɛɛ ane bǝ tanyɛme bɔbɔk; <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />ir keŋ ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik ne bla, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ne duŋu uyi tetɛɛ ne ayu aneshir tetɛk abɛ gɔŋmimi.&gt;&gt; Fe ikpa nyaga ne rɛ ne ti kɛ Arik, waŋ ndi Ibrai ne tanyɛme ben abɔu Arik waŋ ndi a duŋ abɛ ku akama lu ilɛ maa na Gli iki yiŋ ndi bane yeme ba tǝ bɛ yime. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ibrai ne tanyɛme te na zhɔk susun, ndi ankɔŋ ane zhɔk susun ba ne yime ba, neyi amɛ &lt;&lt;neyi tetɛɛ ne gɔŋmimi.&gt;&gt; Ir keŋ ndi icɛr ne blama, &lt;&lt;Nŋli mi itei kli du ir keŋ ndi ncinces yime.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ibrai ne yar ase amkplik azhiin; ama itanyɛme maa bane duŋ kpa maa sik ba ndi itanyɛme maa ne ka dɔ, ndi Saratu wa maa ba tei na ŋli amumun ba. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Itanyɛme maa bane duŋu ba, bane glak kpa nyak yi Arik ba itanyɛme maa ne duŋu shaga ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, tena duŋu agbar Arik asak. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Neme Ibrai ne tanyɛme ne susun maa tedi Arik atei na ki iyi kpa nyak maa. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Nǝ tanyɛme iyi Ibrai, ne yi tsetser ben Arik,&lt;&lt;Arik ne ta tsetser maa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Nkan lǝlɛmɛ &lt;&lt;ne tau ayi tsetser&gt;&gt; ba ne cɛr wa kiki maa ba. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Ne na cɛr taba abaŋ ndi atei ta ta abɛ yi tsetser, abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛme ben waŋ ndi ne lik Yesɔ Ngɔŋ mɔr ne bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Ankyak netu ayi lalɛ mɔr Yesɔ ne nek tu maa te ku, ne na lɛgu te tabǝ ta shur bǝn Arik.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Sɔŋ anenen ben Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Azizaŋa ndi sɔŋ mɔr ne te anenen ben Arik ne atu ayi tanyɛme ne susun, ta yine sik susun ben Arik ne atu ayi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Ne Gli ta aŋyaga ne tanyɛme ne didik kɛ Arik, ndi ta klikli me. Neme ta ŋur asa ne shur ayi ndi ta yime neyi ne gab ki ne Ngɔŋ kɛ Arik! <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Tei na ŋur asa ne yik iyah mɔr, te tane zhi tedi iyik iyah iŋle kpa susun; <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Ikpa susun duŋ Arik ata ta, ita ta maa duŋ tayi ne shur ayi. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Ishur ayi yiŋɛ ba tei zhɔk ta shisha ba, te Arik neka shur nyɛr maa ne asusun amɔr ndi amashir agbub ne tuk te nǝk ta Izhu Tsetser maa.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Nǝ mkpaŋ ndi tane yaŋ mgbyamgbyaŋ, Kristi ne ku netu abɛ lalɛ ne mkpaŋ ndi Arik ne hria. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Iyi ne dǝk te iner nuŋ abɛ ta iku kɛ iner tsetser aku mɔ. Inuŋ atei ya ku ne atu ayi iner ne na didik. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ama Arik wa ne tsar nyɛr maa ne atu amɔr: Ndi tane ri yi abɛ na zumimin, Yesɔ ne ku ne atu amɔr! <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Neme azhizhi amaa neka ŋla ta ashur tsetser ne zǝ Arik; anii ne dǝk, fena, atei ta ta shur ne mfu kɛ Arik! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Tane yi abɛ te zor ben Arik, ama ne atu iku kɛ Zu maa. Azizaŋa ta yi akpa amaa, aye nii ne dǝk ta ndi ita shur mɔr iyi tsitsir kɛ Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Fe bai yiŋɛ ankyak ba; ta nyɛr ne ki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nai ne Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi, waŋ ndi ne akam ta ate akpa abɛ Arik.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ademu ben Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Zumimiŋ ne yir gɔŋmimi netu yi ner zhiin, zumimiŋ maa ne Gli iku nyɛmɛ. Iyiŋɛ ne duŋ iku ne vuŋ aneshir bɔbɔk, te kɔte ner tawa ne na zumimiŋ. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Zumimiŋ ne men yine gɔŋmimi te duŋ icɛr iyi Musa ne nyɛ gɔgɔŋ; ama ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi icɛr iyi Musa ne yaŋa, zumimiŋ neyi ne gɔŋmimi, bane Gli ina zumimiŋ mgbamgbaŋ ba. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ama nak kam rɛ mkpaŋ kɛ Ademu te nyak mkpaŋ kɛ Musa, iku ne yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne atu ayi aneshir bɔbɔk, te vuŋ abaŋ ndi bane lalɛ anenen ndi Ademu ba ndi ne kyak zǝ kɔr kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ama iki iyah yiŋɛ ba yi anenen ba, te ilalɛ yi Ademu yi nkaŋkaŋ ben Iki didik yi Arik ndi ner zhiin waŋa. Ayi zub aner tetɛk ne ku ne atu ayi zumimiŋ iyi ner zhiin waŋa. Ama iki didik yi nek Arik inaŋ, fe iki yi nek aneshir ne na didik kɛ ner zhiin waŋ ndi wa ayi Yesɔ Kristi, <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Fena inǝk yi Arik iyi kaaŋkaŋ ben zumimiŋ yi ner zhiin. Nǝ goŋ kɛ lalɛ ner zhiin ma, ne Gli ambuk nyɛmɛ tena Gli,&lt;&lt; Ilalɛ nyɛmɛ&gt;&gt;; ndi ilalɛ ne yime tetɛk, iki didik yi nek Arik &lt;&lt;Bai lalɛ ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ai lɛ kɛ zub te ilalɛ yi ner zhiin, iduŋ iku ne vuŋ aneshir bɔbɔk. Ama iki zhiin ndi ner zhiin waŋa, Yesɔ Kristi ne nai inaŋ kɔte nii, te duŋ abaŋ ndi ne ta iki didik yi Arik tetɛk atei yi ndɔ ben Kristi.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Fena, ndi ne atu ayi lalɛ ner zhiin ne duŋ iku ne yir ben aneshir bɔbɔk, ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa ne na lɛ didik zhiin aneshir bɔbɔk ne ta izuk zhɔk. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Amɛ ndi ilalɛ yi ner zhiin ne duŋ aneshir bɔbɔk alalɛ, ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa netu ayi na iki didik yi ner zhiin iduŋ aner tetɛk atei ta zuk zhɔk.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Icɛr iyi Musa ne bu alɛla teduŋ lalɛ bǝ yi tetɛk; Ama ndi ilalɛ iyir tetɛk, iki didik nak na yir tetɛk maayi, <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Fena, ndi zumimiŋ vu aneshir gar ŋlɔk, iyi amɛ wa izuk zhɔk didik iyi Arik igli sɔŋ tsetser nyɛmɛ, te nǝk ta Ivli kɛ asese ne miŋ kɛ Yesɔ Kristi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Iku ne Zumimiŋ ama itsitsir ne miŋ kɛ Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Fe, aye nii ta tei blai? Ta bǝ nak zen na zumimiŋ teduŋ ita zhɔk iye Arik bǝ saŋ shagai?<verse eid="ROM 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Bai yi amɛ ba! Ta neka men ku ne zumimiŋ; te tei na ŋurkam kɔmɔ ne miŋei? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Neme izhin ne zhi tedi ne suu ta bɔbɔk ne miŋ kɛ Kristi Yesɔ, isu tama ne yaŋ ta ne ku maa. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Nǝ su tama, fe, iyi duŋ ne ruu ta bene bɔu tena ku ndɔ, teduŋ, ndi Arik ne lɛk Kristi ne gbar asak yi mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Tetɛɛ, teduŋ tabǝ sɔŋ ne vli ikɛ yaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ndi ta neka yi ki zhiin bene bɔu ne ku maa ne ankɔŋ ane su, ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa ta tei na yi iki zhiin bene bɔu ne ilu maa tsitsir ndi ne yime. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Ta ne zhi tedi ne kpok kpa mɔr kǝŋe tane ku ben Kristi ne kuŋkun kɛ gen, te duŋ mgbyamgbyaŋ kpa kɛ zumimiŋ abɛ zǝr kɛ, teduŋ kǝr ta bǝ nayi agɛn abɛ zumimiŋ ba. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Tǝ tate ku, neka zuk ta azhɔk ne atu ayi mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ zumimiŋ. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Ndi ta neka ku ndɔ ben Kristi, tane tanyɛme tedi ta tei na yi atsitsir ben abɔu. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Neme ta ne zhi tedi Kristi ne lu ne bɛ fe ba tei na kam aku ba Iku ba tei na yine mgbyamgbyaŋ ne tu maa ba. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Fena, ndi Yesɔ ne ku, zumimiŋ ba na yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ nuŋ ne tu maa ba; fe iyime maa ai yime iyi Arik. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa izhin bǝ baŋ atu amin ndi zhin neka ku ne zumimiŋ, ndi zumimiŋ iyime, ama te yi atsitsir abɛ Arik ne miŋ kɛ Kristi Yesɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Nǝ yiŋɛ, kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ zumimiŋ Gli zhin tsǝne ne akpa ayi be ayiŋɛ ba, te duŋ zhin bǝ zǝ bubu yi men ba. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Kǝr izhin bǝ duŋ igab akpa min nuŋ bǝ duŋ zhin na zumimiŋ ba. Ndi amɛ, izhin bǝ kam nek Arik atu amin, ndi aner abaŋ ndi ne gli ba akama rɛ miŋ iku anyɛ yir miŋ sɔŋ tsetser; neme, izhin bǝ nek Arik igyaŋ akpa min te duŋu abɛ na iki tsetser neyi me. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Zumimiŋ ba tei Gli zhin ba; te ba zhin kusɔŋ ne angus akɛ cɛr iyi Musa ba ama ne ta zhɔk iye Arik.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agɛn abɛ Tsetser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Fe, anii? te tabǝ na zumimiŋ, ndi bata ri yi ne angus ayi cɛr Musa ba ama ne ina didik kɛ Arik? Iyiŋɛ bai te ba! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Amɛ izhin ne zhi tedi iki ndi izhin te zei ai yi kam zhin te agɛn amaa ka? Izhin tei ya te agɛn abɛ zumimiŋ, kɔ zhin bǝ zǝ kɔr kɛ Arik, keŋ ndi duŋ zhin yi atsetser. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ama mne nyɛr Arik! Tǝ ne mkpaŋ nuŋ izhin ne ben yi agɛn abɛ zumimiŋ, izhin ne zǝ lɛ keŋ ndi ta ne nek zhin ne kǝ susun zhiin. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Neka zuk zhin ashur ne na zumimiŋ min te yi agɛn abɛ yi ne sɔŋ kɛ tsetser. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />(Mtar zhin lǝlɛ tǝ tar kɔte bɛr tayi ne aŋa ne yaŋ mgbyamgbyaŋ min iyi kpa.) Nǝ mkpaŋ nuŋ izhin nek atu amin ne na agɛn iyaŋ tsetser ben na kiki mimin iyi kǝr nyak ne asusun amin. Ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa izhin bǝ nek akpa amin ne te agɛn abɛ tsǝn kɛ tsetser te duŋ izhin bǝ yi tsetser. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Mkpaŋ keŋ ndi izhin ne yi agɛn abɛ zumimiŋ, izhin ne yi isha nena iki didik. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Tǝ izhin ne baŋ anii ndi iduŋ zhin te ishisha mai? Tǝ iklɛtu iyi ki yiŋɛ ai ku! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ama azizaŋa izhin neka ta izuk azhɔk rǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ zumimiŋ te kam te agɛn abɛ Arik. I yaŋ min ai vli kɛ shaga ben abɔu, fe iklɛ tu mɔ iyi ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Tǝ zumimiŋ igli iku nyɛmɛ; ama iki nek iye Arik iyi ivli kɛ asese ne miŋ kɛ yaŋ ben Kristi Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Isɔŋ kɛ ŋa didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Mne nzhi te izhin tei zhi iki yiŋ ndi M tei mblai, akpa amuŋ, ndi izhin ne zhi icɛr yi Musa bɔbɔk. Icɛr iyi Musa ma iyi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne atu aner abaŋ ndi ayi ne vli ankyak.<verse eid="ROM 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Iwa ne ŋa, ta bǝ tɔu, cɛr iyi Musa ne di ayi ne angus akɛ lu maa imla ne ku; ate ku, fe ne kluk ririk kɛ ŋama azhɔk ne kpa iyi icɛr Musa ne kpau. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Fena, ate gar ŋa ner nuŋ ndi lu maa ari yime, atei zhɔu te iwa ne zǝ alulum; ate yi ŋdi lu maa te ku, ambuk neka zu gu azhɔk kɔ ndi ate aŋa lulum nuŋ ba azǝ alulum ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Waŋa ayi ir keŋ ndi iyi amɛ ben abɛ zhin, Ndi tane zhi icɛr iyi Musa iyime, izhin ne ku minyi te izhin yi kpa zhiin ben Kristi; fena azizaŋa izhin yi amaa abaŋ ndi ne lɛgu ne ku te tabǝ yi abɛ na ndum didik kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Nǝ mkpaŋ ndi tane ben sɔŋ ne kpa kǝŋe, ne kpa kɛ bubu ndi icɛr iyi Musa ne zen na ndum ne miŋ kɛ akpa mɔr, teduŋ bɔbɔk iki yi na mɔr ne klɛ ne iku. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Azizaŋa, fena, neka azukta ashur are icɛr iyi Musa, te tane ku ne yiŋ ndi ne ben akpa ta ne jaru. Ba ta ri zeu ne ankɔŋ ane icɛr iyi Musa ba, ama ne ankɔŋ ayayas ane Izhu iyi Arik.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Icɛr yi Musa ben Zumimiŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Tei di kikin, fei? te icɛr iyi Musa ma iyi zumimiŋǝ? Ba ye amɛ ba! Ayi icɛr iyi Musa iyi ne duŋ me nzhi aye nii ai lalɛ. Abɛdi icɛr iyi Musa bane di, &lt;&lt;Duŋ te bubu ne ki iyi nuŋ ba,&gt;&gt; ba Mbǝ nzhi te azho anii te ibubu ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ama ne alɛla ane nek ne icɛr iyi Musa ne duŋ ayik ankɔŋ anuŋ, kiki iyi nyɛr tu yi tik ayi ne miŋ muŋ. Icɛr iyi Musa bate yime ba, zumimiŋ bai bǝ yime ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Nga muŋ yi mne yi tsitsir ne yaŋ icɛr iyi Musa; ama ndi icɛr iyi Musa ne nyɛ, zumimiŋ ne kam te tsitsir, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />fe Nga mne nku. Ndi icɛr iyi Musa ne iyi Gli vli nyɛmɛ, ne muŋ ne Gli iku nyɛmɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />zumimiŋ ne yik alɛla, ne ankɔŋ ane icɛr iyi Musa te cɔk me te ŋun me. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ne me, icɛr iyi Musa tu maa iyi tsetser, inǝk ilɛmɛ iyi tsetser, anenen tena rɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ama waŋa ayi ki iyi duŋ ki didik zhɔm iku i? Bai yi amɛ ba! Ai zumimiŋ yi ne Gli ku nyɛmɛ; ne na ki iyi rɛ, zumimiŋ ne Gli ku nyɛm ma, teduŋ ilalɛ bǝ mwaŋ ru. Fena, netu ayi icɛr iyi Musa zumimiŋ mimin ne muŋ ru klɛ ndende.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmɔ ne miŋ susun kɛ aneshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Tane zhi tedi icɛr iyi Musa iyi tsetser; nga myi neshir ne azhizhi ben na, keŋ ndi ne baŋ me alɛb ndi igen ne zumimiŋ. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Ba mzhi iki yiŋ ndi mnai ba; Iki yiŋ ndi mwɔb tem nai, bai yi mnai ba, ama mkam yik mzǝn na iki yiŋ ndi mkyagǝ. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Tǝ iki ndi mkyak nai ai yi mnai, iyiŋɛ ne tsar te di mne ntanyɛme tǝ ndi icɛr iyi Musa ma iyi anenen. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Fe na ba ayi nga wa mna ki yiŋɛ ba; ayi zumimiŋ yiŋ ndi kusɔŋ ne miŋ muŋ. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Mne zhi te ndi iki didik ba yine miŋ muŋ ba; mdi, ne kpa muŋ kɛ azhizhi. kɔ ndi amɛ ite bubu muŋ iyi na iki didik, ama bam zhi nai ma ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Ba mna iki didik ndi mwɔb nai ba; neme, mkam yik mzǝn na iki mimin ndi susun muŋ bane tanyɛme ne nai ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Ate yi ndi mna iki ndi bam tanyɛme ne nai ba, fena ba ayi nga wa mnai ba; akam ayi zumimiŋ ndi sɔŋ ne miŋ muŋ ai yi na. <verse eid="ROM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Te yi ndi mna ki yiŋ ndi bam ne ndi mnai ba, iyiŋɛ ne tsar te ba ayi nga wa mnai ba; fe, ayi zumimin iyi ndi iyi ne miŋ muŋ. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Miŋ dur muŋ nak nyɛr na icɛr iyi Musa. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Ama mnak nkam yik icɛr iyi Musa izen na ndum ne miŋ kpa muŋ; icɛr iyi Musa ndi zen vu mgbu ndi idur muŋ ne tanyɛme neyi. Iyiŋɛ duŋ mkam te gen ne icɛr iyi Musa yi zumimiŋ yiŋ ndi zen na ndum ne miŋ kpa muŋ. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Nga mdik yi ner nǝsha kai! Ŋɔwa atei zuk me azhɔk ne kpa kǝŋe ndi gbur me gar tsik ŋunǝ? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Mne nyɛr Arik waŋ ndi wa ana yiŋɛ ire ben Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Fe, ne yiŋɛ, waŋa ayi iki ndi myi ne miŋe; ne baŋ yi dur muŋ M tei zǝ icɛr iyi Musa yi ankyak ne susun muŋ, ikpa muŋ kɛ kam zǝ icɛr iyi Musa yi zumimiŋ.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Tsǝn ne Izhu Tsetser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Fena azizaŋa abaŋ ndi ayi ndɔ ben Yesɔ Kristi ba atei tyak ba ahrie ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Tǝ nkanlɛ yi Izhu Tsetser, ndi inǝk ta vli, ndi izuk me zhɔk rɛ nkanlɛ yi zumimiŋ ben iku. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Iki ndi nkanlɛ yi Musa bane dik zhi nai ba, te kpa kɛ na bǝn azhizhi kǝŋe ne nai lak kana, Arik ne nai. Ndi ane shar Izu maa ne miŋ kɛ kpa neshir ne na zumimiŋ te abɛ kam ate tuk amkpur ane zumimiŋ. Fe te abaŋ zumimiŋ tsik acɔk ala ne miŋ kpa kɛ neshir ndi ne shar Izu maa, waŋ ndi ne nyɛ ne kpa kɛ neshir kɛ zumimiŋ, te abɛ anyɛ zir zumimiŋ aglɛ tibɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Arik nena amɛ teduŋ iki ndi nkanlɛ yi Musa ne wɔbo ibǝ shaga ne miŋ taba ndi ta tsin ne ankɔŋ ane Izhu ba ankɔŋ ane kpa kɛ na ben azhizhi ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Abaŋ ndi aduŋ kpa kɛ na ben azhizhi igli ba tsǝne asusun amene asɔŋ ne kiki yiŋ ndi lɛk bubu yi kpa kǝŋe. Abaŋ ndi aduŋ Izhu bla ba iki yi na, ayi Izhu mɔ iyi duŋ ba ana iki yiŋ ndi wa ne tanyɛme neyi. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Aner abaŋ ndi azǝ men kɛ kpa kɛ na ben azhizhi kǝŋe ba yi ndɔ ben Arik ba; abaŋ ndi aduŋ Izhu Gli ba tsǝne aba ayi ndɔ ben Arik te ben zhɔk susun. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Fe amɛ aneshir abɛ zǝ men kɛ kpa yi abɛ te zor ben Arik; te ba zǝ nkanlɛ yi Arik, ba atei men azhi zei me ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Abaŋ ndi azǝ men kɛ bu yi kpa kǝŋe ba tei nek Arik nyɛr ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Izhineba, ba tei duŋ kpa kɛ na ben azhizhi bǝ tsar zhin iki yi na ba; Izhin bǝ duŋ Izhu yi Arik bǝ tsar zhin iki yi na; atei ndi Izhu mɔ yine miŋ min. Waŋ ndi bate yine Izhu yi Yesɔ ba, ba ayou Arik ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ama atei ndi Kristi ayine miŋ min, Izhu mɔ iyi vli min te neka aŋɔk zhin azhɔk anenen ne ti kɛ Arik, <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Ate yi ndi Izhu yi Arik, yiŋ ndi ne lɛk Yesɔ rɛ miŋ bɛ, iyi ne miŋ min, Iwaŋ ndi ne lɛk Yesɔ are miŋ bɛ me wa atei nek Vli ma ne miŋ kpa min ndi Vli yi ne miŋ min. <verse eid="ROM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Fena, amunya, ta yi ne ndum kɛ na Arik, ba zhin tei na zǝ iki ndi kpa kǝŋe nyeri ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Izhin te zǝ men kɛ kpa kǝŋe, izhin tei ku; ama izhin te duŋ Vli kɛ Arik ŋun kiki mimin yi kpa, izhin tei sɔŋ atsitsir. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Abaŋ ndi izhu yi Arik Gli ba tsǝne aba ayi amumun abɛ Arik. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Tǝ Izhu ndi Arik ne nek zhin aneyi ba yi kam zhin te agɛn ben abɛ te sisik ba; Izhu mɔ nak kam zhin te amumun abɛ Arik, Mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Izhu mɔ kɛ duŋ ta te ahwa tedi &lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ! Tetɛɛ amuŋ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Izhu yi Arik nyɛ biŋ atu bǝn izhu mɔr te bla tedi ta yi amumun Arik. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Azizaŋa ndi ta yi amumun amaa, ta tei gli iki didik ndi ne aŋyak taba aneshir amaa, ta tei nak gli ndɔ bǝn Kristi iki ndi Arik ne anyagu neyi; ate yi ndi ta tei gli nzenzen maa, ta tei nak gli yik iya maa.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋgɔŋ kɛ ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Iya ndi ta yigǝ azizaŋa ba mwe ndi nzenzen keŋ ndi atei tsar ta ne kɛ ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Tǝ gɔŋmimi mayi ŋub bɛr ndi Arik atei bu amumun amaa atsar ne abɛm. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Tǝ gɔŋmimi ne yir miŋ kɛ cɔkla ne atu yi lalɛ, ba ne miŋ kɛ ta nyɛmɛ maa ba, ama ne tanyɛme yi Arik. Ishur ayi ne ti ne yime <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />tedi gɔŋmimi maayi atei zuk kɛ azhɔk are gen kɛ be itei ta izuk zhɔk nzenzen yi amumun abɛ Arik. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Ta ne zhi tedi kam nyak azizaŋa bɔbɔk gɔŋmimi me zen te antum ndi izhin nnɛ iwa ne ŋli. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Fena ba ayi gɔŋmimi kɛ ankyak zen te antummɔ ba; taba mɔr yi ndi ta yine Vli maa ndi yi nek Arik yi kuti maa zen te antum ne miŋ ne ndi ta zen ŋub te Arik abɛ nek ta ŋgɔŋ mɔr kɛ amumun amaa te ata ta ashur bɔbɔk. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ne nek ta ishur ayi ne ti yiŋɛ ne bɛr ndi ne zuk ta ashur. Ama ishur ayi ne ti ndi ayige bai shur ayi ne ti ba. Ayi ŋɔwa asak ayi ne ki yiŋ ndi ayige? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ate yi ndi ta shur ayi ne ki yiŋ ndi ba ta nlu zen yigǝ ba, ta shur kpa zee te ŋubǝ. <verse eid="ROM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ayi amɛ wa Izhu ayou Arik nyɛ lɔk kpa mɔr kɛ ruruk kǝŋe. Ba ta zhi nkan ndi ta tei ben Arik neyi ba, ama ayi Izhu ayou Arik te vu ben mɔrɔ ne antum ayiŋ ndi ba aru arɛ lilɛn ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Arik wa ndi asu ayi ayik miŋ asusun amɔr, ayi wa ne zhi ki ndi yine miŋ susun kɛ Vli ma; te Vli me kɛ alɛ ben Arik netu ayi aneshir amaa anenen ndi Arik ne atsar atɔ mɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Ta ne zhi tedi Arik aduŋ kɔte ki tayi bǝ kam ŋɔk nyak na ndum didik ne atu abɛ nye ru, abaŋ ndi ne zhɔ ba anenen ne iki ndi wa Arik ne di. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Arik ne mǝne zhi aneshir amaa ire asese, ayi wa ne amen hria ba te aŋla ba akam ate ndi Izu maa, te duŋ Izu maa wa abɛ yi Vǝn mla yi abɛ yaŋ yime bene abɔu. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Abaŋ ndi Arik ne hria ba, ane azho ba; abaŋ ndi ane azho ba, ane Gli ba anyaŋ ne kpa ma, fe te nek ba ŋgɔŋ maa.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyɛr yi Arik ne miŋ kɛ Kristi Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Ta tei di anii ne kiki yiŋɛi? Arik atei ben abɛta, ayi ŋɔwa atei flak aŋin azik tamai? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Arik wa ndi bane aku Izu maa ayir tama ba, te akamu anǝk ta bɔbɔk! Ba atei nak ana nek ta kɔte anii kai? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ayi ŋɔwa atei wɔb akla bǝn abaŋ ndi Arik ne ahria bai? Arik ne gli ba aŋyak ne kpa maa! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Ayi ŋɔwa atei zǝr ba atyak ahrie? Nuŋ ba yime ba, te Kristi Yesɔ ne ku netu amɔr, te ana lu ne bɛ netu amɔr, te akɔsɔŋ ne ŋɔk li kɛ Arik te azǝn ben ne tu amɔr! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Ayi ŋɔwa, atei yar ta adɛme ne miŋ kɛ nyɛr Kristi? Ayi wɔb alɛ, kai iyik iyah, kai kyak iyi kai ijɔŋ kai mgbawun kai ki yi wɔb ŋun kɔ kai iku iyi? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ndi lɛ Arik nen di;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">&lt;&lt;Ne atu mi ta yik iyah ndi ta tei ku kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">Ta yi ndi awanta abaŋ ndi agar yak ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Kɔ ne min kɛ amɛ tane ka li rab kǝŋe te shaan ne atu ayi Kristi waŋ ndi anyɛr ta. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Mne nta nyɛmɛ mgbamgbaŋ te ndi iki yi yar ta dɛmɛ ne nyɛr yi Kristi ba yime ba. kɔ iku kɔ sɔŋ tsetser, kɔ abɛ shar ayou Arik kɔ anerim, kɔ iki ye azizaŋa kɔ iyi nyɛ ne ti, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />kɔ iki yi rɛ shu kɔ iyi gɔŋmimi iki yi yar ta deme ne nyɛr Yesɔ ba dik yime ne bɔbɔk gɔŋmimi kǝŋe ba iyiŋ ndi iyi mɔr ne miŋ kɛ Kristi Yesɔ Arik amɔr Ŋgɔŋ<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Arik ben Aneshir abɛ hria amaa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Mbla lɛ didik; nga m you Kristi te bam ti mu ba. Idur muŋ ben Izhu Tsetser ne blam tedi bam ti mu ba <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Susun muŋ ne cɔk la tetɛk yaŋ gbur klɛ <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />fe netu ayi aner amuŋ, na ben azhizhi amuŋ! Mne nta nyɛmɛ te arim abɛ vuŋ me te ayar me agli adɛ me ben Yesɔ ne atu amen. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Aner abɛ Isrela; ayi wa ne kam ba ate aner amaa te abu nzenzen maa atsar ba; te ana kpa nyak maa ben aba te anǝk ba lɛ kɛ Musa; aba ayi ne ben Arik anenen; aba ne ta kpa anu ididik yi Arik; <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Ibrai, Ishaku, ben Yakubu aba ayi atsintsim amene, Yesɔ ma ne miŋ kɛ kpa kǝŋe aneyi ner ne Isrela. Wa ayi Arik ndi kɔte nii yine angus amaa, abɛ nak ata ngɔŋ maa kɛ asese! Bǝ yi amɛ <verse eid="ROM 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Bam ndi kpa nyak yi Arik ne zir hrie ba; te ba ayi bɔbɔk aner abɛ Isrela ba ayi aner abɛ Arik ba. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Ba ayi bɔbɔk nga kɛ Ibrai ba ayi amumun abɛ Arik ba. Arik ne di Ibrai, &lt;&lt;Nga mi keŋ ndi mne mkpaŋ nyagu itei ru rɛ ben Ishaku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ne yiŋɛ iyi nŋli kɛ Ibrai ba duŋ neshir ayi izu Arik ba; ama amumun abaŋ ndi ŋli ba ne kpa nyak iyi Arik aba ayi ŋli kɛ Ibrai didik. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Tǝ ikpa nyak yi Arik ne nkanlɛ yiŋɛ: &lt;&lt;M tei kam nyak ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi mne bla, te Saratu atei ŋli vǝvǝn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Bane amɛ ankyak ba. Ama Rifkatu ne ŋli amumun ayaa ndi tetɛɛ amene ayi zhiin, ntsǝntsǝm amɔr Ishaku. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Ama Arik ne hria zhiin ne miŋe te bɛ duŋ ilɛ kɛ bla maa bɛ shaga, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Arik ne diu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔŋɔ atei zekur ivǝtsob o.&gt;&gt; Arik ne bla amɛ te shi ŋli ba, te ne zhi na iki didik kɔkai mimin; Fe ihria ye Arik ne yi ir kɛ zhɔ maa, ba ne na ikinuŋ men ba. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Ndi lɛ kɛ Arik ne di, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nyɛr Yakubu te nkyak Isuwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Tǝ tabǝ di, na, Arik ne na anenen kai? Ba yeme ba. <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Arik ne di Musa, &lt;&lt;M tei lɔ susun bǝn iwaŋ ndi susun muŋ ne tanyɛme ben abɔu; M tei na sik susun ben waŋ ndi mne tanyɛme ben abɔu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Neme, ba kɔte anii ina ne wɔb iyi neshir ka nena maa ba, ama ne lɔ susun kɛ Arik ankyak. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Tǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di Firauna, &lt;&lt;Mne duŋu ubǝ yi itum te mbǝ ntsar mgbyamgbyaŋ muŋ ne atu ami te abɛ bla sak muŋ ashak gɔŋmimi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Ne amɛ, Arik alɔ susun kɛ ner waŋ ndi susun maa ne tanyɛme, tena duŋ inuŋ abɛ kyak wɔ lɛ ne tanyɛme maa.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfu ben lɔ susun yi Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Ama ba nuŋ ne miŋ min atei dim, &lt;&lt;Atei yi ndi iyi amɛ, te Arik ate vuŋ nuŋ ne lalɛ kikinei? Ŋɔwa atei ya kyak iki na Arik?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ama uyi ŋɔwa, ikpa muŋ, te ubǝ kyak iki yi na Arik? Mkpalin yi mɛ ne ndǝndem itei rib ner ne mɛi ma te di, une mɛm amɛ te nii?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Ankyak, ba yi ner waŋ ndi wa ne mɛ mkpalin wa yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ na mɛ nuŋ yiŋ ndi atei na ndum ngɔŋɔ neyi, tena mɛ nuŋ vǝtsɔb te bena na ndum vǝtsɔb ane yi, nak rɛ mimi zhin iyiŋe.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Fe ate yiŋ ndi Arik adi ki yiŋɛ wa ne nai. Iwa atei gli mfu maa rumɔ te abɛ yik mgbyamgbyaŋ. Ama ayi ner ne vuŋ susun te na vuŋ kpa Gli ben abaŋ ndi ne duŋu ate mfu, ne mla abɛ ku. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Awɔb te wa abɛ Gli ngɔŋ rumɔ, ir keŋ ndi ne shur taba baŋ ndi ne lɔ susun mɔr, taba ndi ta ne ka na kiki yi ta ngɔŋ maa. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Tǝ ta yi aneshir mdi ne zhɔ ba, ba yi Yahuda ankyak ba ama ben abaŋ ndi bai Yahudawa ba. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi icɛr ne mplɛ kɛ Hosiya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">&lt;&lt;Aneshir abaŋ ndi ba yi amuŋ ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Mǝ tei zhɔ ba &lt;te Anere muŋ.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Anere baŋ ndi bam nyer ba ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Mǝ te zhɔ ba te &lt;abɛ nyere amuŋ.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Nǝ amkpa awaŋ ndi Arik ne bla ba, &lt;te di ba zhin yi aneshire amuŋ ba.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">Ne ankpama atei zhɔ ba amun abɛ Arik ne vli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Ne tu yi Isrela Ishaya ne tɔ bla ti ne di: &lt;&lt;kɔ aneshir abɛ Isrela ayi tetɛk ndi ablubluk ayi nek watsɔb ankyak atei lieru; <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Ankyak Arik atei nama te gɔŋmimi ŋas.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Waŋa ir keŋ ndi Ishaya ne bla, &lt;&lt;Abɛ di ba Arik Ŋgɔŋ bane duŋ ta nga nuŋ ba, ta bǝ yiŋ ndi Saduma, tei bǝ yi ndi Gomɔra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isrela ne kyak tanyɛme ne lɛ kɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Ankyak ta tei na kikin ben abaŋ ndi ba yi Yahudawa ba, abaŋ ndi bane tanyɛme te aba bɛ wɔb te zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik ba, ne ta ba ne tanyɛme men; <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Fe aneshir bǝ Isrela, azǝn wɔb kpa nyak ndi te yi anenen ne ti kɛ Arik bane yigǝ ba. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />A yi ne duŋ yi amɛ? Ba ne tara kli ne tanyɛme men ba ama nena kiki yi yik ayi. Ne zin tara aza &lt;&lt;ne mkpaŋ yi tara aza.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Ir keŋ ndi cɛr ne bla:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Tɔ me nyak mkpaŋ ne sihiyona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Ndi tei duŋ aneshir atara za.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Ama waŋ ndi mtanyeme ben abɔu ba tei di mne tun zhiu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Akpa amuŋ, ai bɛdi ai yik ne susun muŋ te aner amuŋ abɛ lieru! Ir keŋ ndi me mben Arik ne atu amen! <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />M tei nduŋ zhin bǝ zhi te anere ne su tu ne nkɔŋ kɛ zhi ilɛ kɛ Arik; ama inek tu mǝne ba iyi ne atu ayi mgbemgbebɛ kɛ tu ba. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Aneshire bane zhi ankɔŋ tsetser awaŋ ndi are ben Arik ba te duŋ ba bane nek atu men ne lɛ didik kɛ Arik ba. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Ndi amɛ Kristi ne gli ina nyak gar klɛtu, teduŋ iwaŋ ndi ate tanyɛmɛ ne susun didik ben Arik.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ita zhɔk iyi kɔte ŋɔwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Anebi Musa ne cɛr tedi ina didik se zǝ ilɛ nyak: &lt;&lt;Ineshir waŋ ndi ana kiki yiŋɛ atei sɔŋɔ neyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Ama ilɛ kɛ Arik ne ina didik ndi tanyɛme iyaŋ yik adi: &lt;&lt;Duŋ di ne susun mi, &lt;Ŋɔwa atei yuŋ shu?&gt;&gt;&gt; Tǝ abe te Gli Kristi azime <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />&lt;&lt;Uyi ŋɔwa te utei rib, kɔka ai ŋɔwa atei zi are shu te nyɛ gɔŋmimi?&gt;&gt;&gt; te, igli Kristi lumɔ ne miŋ kɛ ku. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Ama iki yi blama idi: &lt;&lt;Ilɛ mɛ Arik iyi gbahir bene bɛ zhin, iyi ne anu amin tena yi ne asusun amin,&gt;&gt; watɔ, nkanlɛ iyi tanyɛme iyiŋ ndi ta du kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ate yi ndi utǝ tanyɛme ne susun mi te bu anu bla te Yesɔ ayi Ŋgɔŋ te tanyɛme tedi Arik ne lɛgu ne ku, utei yik ita zhɔk <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Tǝ ne tanyɛme iyi susun tena yik na didik ben Arik, fe ne anu amɔr ta ne bla iklu aŋin mɔr tena ta zuk zhɔk. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik idi, &lt;&lt;Iner waŋ ndi ate tanyɛme bene bɔu batei nǝgu shisha ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Tǝ nkaŋkaŋ nuŋ ba yime ne miŋ Yahudawa ben abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba Ŋgɔŋ zhiin wa ayi Ŋgɔŋ bɔbɔk tena nek anu adidik netu abɛ zhɔu bɔbɔk. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di, &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ate zhɔ isak kɛ Ŋgɔŋ atei yik ita zhɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Ama atei na kikin te zhɔ waŋ ndi bane tanyɛme bene bɔu kai? Fe atei na kikin te mtanyeme ben iwaŋ ndi bane wɔ kinuŋ ne atu maa kai? Tǝ atei na kikin te wɔ mba nuŋ ate du ba ilɛ mɛ ka? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Tǝ atei na kikin te du ilɛ mɛ mba ate shar ba ka? Ir keŋ ndi Ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di, &lt;&lt;Nak tɔ ire kɛ aza aner abaŋ ndi agli ilɛ kɛ men anyɛ me ne atu ayi Yesɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ama bai aner bɔbɔk ne ta ilɛ kɛ men kǝŋe ba, Ishaya ne bla tɔ ti ne lɛ kɛ Arik adi &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, iŋɔwa ne mtanyeme ne lɛ kɛ du mɔr?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Fena itanyɛme irurɛ ne iwɔ du lɛ, fe awɔ idu ilɛmɛ ire du lɛ netu ayi Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ama m rib: Ai zub te bane wɔ ilɛ kɛ Arik kai? Ai zub ne wɔ kɛ ndi lɛ kɛ Arik ne di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">&lt;&lt;Akɔr amene ne yir kɔte me ne gɔŋmimi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">Ililɛ mǝne ne yir klɛtu yi gɔŋmimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Fe mtar na rib: Aner bɔbɔk bane zhi kai? Musa ne kuti bla lɛ kɛ Arik adi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt;M tei nduŋ aner abɛ te ankiŋki ben abaŋ ndi ba ayi ntun ngɔŋ ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">M tei nduŋ zhin bǝ te rǝra netu ayi ntun yiŋ ndi bane zhi kinuŋ ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">M tei duŋ abaŋ ndi ba yi ne ntun yiŋɛ ba abɛ yi abliblik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">M tei nduŋ aneshir amuŋ ate mfu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Fe Ishaya ine bla tɔ ti ne lɛ kɛ Arik azhɔk kpa te di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;Ne yik me bene abaŋ ndi bane wɔb me ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;Mne ngli tu muŋ rumɔ bene abaŋ ndi bane arib me ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Fena ate yi ndi aner Isrela, Ishaya ine bla tɔ ti ne lɛ kɛ Arik adi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">&lt;&lt;Mne mbaŋ mkpaŋ te zen bu aŋɔk tem ta abɛ yaŋ wɔ lɛ muŋ ben aner abɛ wɔb akla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Arik ne lɔ susun aner abɛ Isrela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Fe, Mǝ rib: Arik ne kyak aner amaa i? Ba yi amɛ ba! Nga muŋ yi myi awonǝ Isrela, nga nŋli kɛ Ibrai, ire aŋa ayi Banyami. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Arik bane kyak aner amaa ba, abaŋ ndi ane mǝne hria ba ne kuti. Ba zhin ne zhi te ilɛ kɛ Arik idi ne ŋake amkpawaŋ ndi netu Iliya ne bla tɔ ti ne lɛ kɛ Arik ir keŋ ndi ne ben Arik netu aner abɛ Isrela: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Ŋgɔŋ, ne ŋlɔk nki aneshir abɛ bla shar mǝ te zǝr amkpa ne tsik ibaŋ; Ai nga kiki muŋ mne ndǝk, fe ana wɔb ankɔŋ ane ŋun me.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Fe Arik ne sagu ma tedi kikin? &lt;&lt;Bau yi kiki mi ba! Mne nyak nki aner amkpik amɛ ataŋgba abaŋ ndi bane zekuu Balaam ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Nǝ yeme, azizaŋa nki aner watsɔb ayime abaŋ ndi Arik ne hria ba ne na didik ma. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Ihria ma iyi ne na didik maa, bane iki yi na men ba. Atei yi ndi ihria yi Arik yi ne na iki na aneshir, fe ina didik maa ba yi didik ba.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Fe aye nii? Iki yiŋ ndi aner abɛ Isrela ne wɔ bǝ ngɔŋ bane yigǝ ba, ama abaŋ ndi Arik ne hria ba ne yik, ankime ne ku atɔŋ ne ilɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Ndi ilɛ kɛ ne di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">&lt;&lt;Arik ne duŋ idur men ben asusun amen akama te abliblik; ire ibɛre batei na yik te na wɔ ba:&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Ankyak Doda adi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">&lt;&lt;Abɛ sɛr ba atyak azhɔk tena jaŋ ba ne za;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">Abɛ zhaku, abɛ na nek ba iyah!<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Duŋ ayi amene abɛ te amfik kǝr abɛ na yik ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">Tǝ agɔŋ amen abɛ kam ate mkpɔ iyaŋ klɛtu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Fe, M rib: Ndi Yahudawa ne azhaku ne kyak zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik, bane zhaku te na lu kai? Ba yi amɛ ba! Nena zumimin, iliru ne nyɛ ben abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba, ne duŋ Yahudawa ne te ankiŋki. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ilalɛ iyi Yahudawa ne Gli iliru ben anu adidik igli nyɛ gɔŋmimi, ben iyah men iyi zhu tsetser ne Gli anu adidik igli abaŋ ndi ba yi Yahudawa ba. Fe, iki didik ngɔŋ itei yi kikin ndi Yahudawa atei yi ne miŋe!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iliru iyi abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Mli azizaŋa ben abɛ zhin abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba: Ndi myi ne du lɛ kɛ Arik ben abaŋ ndi bai Yahudawa ba, M tei ŋɔr asa ne ndum muŋ. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Neme M tei duŋ aneshir abaŋ ndi ayi aner amuŋ ate ankiŋki, tǝ bɛ zǝ anuŋ ne miŋ mǝne. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Ndi ne kyak aneshir abɛ Isrela ba, nki aneshir te kama sen nena zumimin men te kama yi akpa amaa. Fe itei yi kikini, ndi ate ta bai? Itei yi ivli ben abɛ ku!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ate yi ndi mgbalak borodi kɛ kuti ne nek Arik ne kǝ, fena antsuk borodime ayi amaa; ate nek Arik iririŋ kuŋkun, anga kuŋkuno anayi amaa.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Teyi ndi ate tsi ngǝŋga kuŋkun inebi nuŋ ahrie, ate baŋ nga kuŋkun ikɛ izhu tsetser nuŋ adus ne yuŋɔ. Izhin abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba izhin yi ndi nga kuŋkun ikɛ dus yuŋɔ, teyi ne susun kɛ izhu tsetser azizaŋa ndi aba Yahudawa ma. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Fe na, kǝr izhin bɛ ŋur asa ben abaŋ ndi ne tsi ba ndi ngǝŋga iyi kuŋkuno ba. U na kikin te uŋur asa i? Unak yi nga ankyak; bau zok ririŋ ŋli tiŋ kuŋkuno ba, iririŋe yi gliu.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ama utei di, &lt;&lt;Iyime, ne sɛr angama atyak ahrie te mbǝ yik alɛla.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Ayi lɛ didik. Ne tsi ba atyak ahrie te bane tanyɛme ben Arik ba, fe uwa uklikli te une tanyɛme ben Arik. Ama kǝr ubǝ ŋur asa ba; ama, ubǝ te sǝsǝk. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Arik bane kam Yahudawa aŋyak ba, abaŋ ndi ayi ndi amene yi ngǝŋga kuŋkun yi izhu tsetser; izhin yik tedi atei duŋ zhin? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Fena izhin bǝ tɔ ir keŋ ndi Arik ayi ne sik tu tena yi ine yaŋ sik kpa: ba sik kpa ben abaŋ ndi ne zhaku ba, ama asik tu ne atu amin, atei ndi izhin Gli sik tu maa. Mba amɛ ba, ijineba imin yi atei tsi zhin ahrie. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Ate yi ndi Yahudawa ate tanyɛme, Arik atei gli ba akam aŋyak ne amkpa ndi neyi amen; Arik aya amɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Nǝ yiŋɛ, izhineba ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba izhin yi ndi nga kuŋkun tiŋ inebi keŋ ndi ne sɛr kɛ, ndi bane men yi maa ba, ne dus kɛ tiŋ kuŋkun inebi. Yahudawa ayi yaŋ lɔmɔ te Arik abɛ dus anga kuŋkun ndi ne sɛre ne tiŋ kuŋkun kǝŋe.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arik alɔ susun aneshir bɔbɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Amunya, iki didik yi suyir iyime, ndi wɔb te izhin bǝ zhi, itei duŋ zhin ir keŋ ndi izhin yi mgbemgbeb. Aner abɛ Isrela iklik atu amen ben yaŋ atɔŋ bane baŋ mkpaŋ ba, ama itei baŋ mkpaŋ ndi abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba ate ta Arik ne asusun amen. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Waŋa ai ir keŋ ndi Arik ai ta aner abɛ Isrela azhɔk. Ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik idi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">&lt;&lt;Ine ta zhɔk atei rɛ Siyona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">Atei baŋ zumimin men bɔbɔk akama atibe ne ŋli kɛ Yakubu.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Mte kpa ilɛ kǝŋe yak bene bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">Ndi M tei baŋ ilalɛ mǝne ntibɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Ndi Yahudawa ne kyak ta ilɛ didik kǝŋe, Yahudawa ayi abɛ te zɔr ben Arik atu ayi abaŋ ndi bai nŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba. Ama ne atu ayi hria iye Arik, ayi akpa abɛ Arik ne atu ayi atsǝntsǝm amen. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Tǝ Arik ba asen ne kiyi hria maa ben inǝk anu adidik maa ba. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Ate yi izhineba abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba, izhin ne glak ilɛ kɛ Arik ikukub; fena azizaŋa izhin ne ta lɔ susun iye Arik ndi Yahudawa ane klik atu te kyak zǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ne ankɔŋ azhin awaŋa, ne atu ayi lɔ susun Arik Yahudawa ma ai na lɔ susun iye Arik menyi. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Tǝ Arik ne duŋ aneshir bɔbɔk aye abɛ kur ne jaru kɛ abɛ lalɛ, te abɛ wɔ lɔ susun mǝne bɔbɔk.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gbar Arik</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Adudun ki aye Arik ayi ne du! Mgbemgbeb maa ilak ben izhi maa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Inuŋ batei bla ki kpa nyak maa ayir ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Ŋɔwa atei zhi ankɔŋ amaa i!<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di &lt;&lt;Ŋɔwa ne zhi susun kɛ Ŋgɔŋ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Ka iŋɔwa atei ya nǝgu lɛ?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Ŋɔwa neka nǝgu ikinuŋǝ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">Tǝ duŋu abɛ kame anegu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Tǝ ikiki bɔbɔk iyi na maa, ikiki bɔbɔk ne yime ne atu amaa te yi maa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">Ŋgɔŋ bǝyi kɛ Arik iyaŋ klɛtu! Bǝ yeme.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Itsin ne nkɔŋ kɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Ndi amɛ, amunya ngam mbenzhin, ne nkɔŋ kɛ lɔ susun kɛ Arik, izhin bǝ nek Arik akpa amin ndi ituk amkpur, ne tsetser sɔŋ kɛ duŋ Arik anyɛr te waŋa ayi ankɔŋ ane izhu tsetser ane zekur Arik. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Kǝr izhin bǝ duŋ asusun amin abɛ te bubu ne kiki iyi gɔŋmimi yiŋɛ ba, ama izhin bǝ duŋ Arik abɛ sen asusun ayi idur min. Nǝ yiŋɛ izhin tei tsar ne zhi iye Arik ne yik maa, ididik, inyɛr ben iyik iyi na maa.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Tǝ ne iki didik ndi Arik ne nǝm Mdi kɔte ŋɔwa ne miŋ min: duŋ di utɔ itu mi ne shu inaŋ nuŋ ba, ama ubǝ zi tu mi zhɔk ne lɛ ne susun, tei tsar tu mi tɔ ne tanyɛme mi ndi Arik ne nǝgu. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Tayi ne igab mkpuŋ kpa tetɛk ne kpa zhiin, fe kɔte gab tayi iyi ne ndum maa. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa, ne miŋ kɛ zǝ Yesɔ tayi gab tetɛk teyi kpa zhiin, te kɔte igab tayi iyi ne miŋ kɛ gaba bɔbɔk. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Ne me, Arik ne nǝk ta kiki iyi na kaaŋkaŋ, ne ir keŋ ndi ne nek ta iki didik maa. Ate yi ndi Arik ne nek iner ibla tɔ ti, duŋu abɛ bla kɛ anenen ne tanyɛme mɔr; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />ate yi ndi ai nǝk iyi na aneshir ndum; ta bena ndum, tei tsar, abɛ tsar; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />ate yi inǝk ilɛ; ta bɛ nek ilɛ, ka ai bu aŋɔk netu abɛ wɔb, abɛ na ne zhɔk ne susun; ka ai gli aneshir, abɛ gli ba bwe; ka ai lɔ susun, ibǝ nai ne zhɔk iti.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Itanyɛme bǝyi susun zhiin. Kyak ki mimin, gli kiyiŋ ndi ire. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Tanyɛmɛ bǝn akpa ami ngɔŋ ne miŋ kɛ zǝ Arik. Izhin bǝ yik ŋgɔŋ kɛ akpa inaŋ atu amin. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Izhin bǝyi abɛ na ndum ngɔŋ ba abɛ te ankɔ ba. Naa zhin Ŋgɔŋ ndum ne susun zhiin ikɛ nǝk tu. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Izhin bǝ nyɛr ne miŋ kɛ shur ayi, izhin bǝ vuŋ kpa ne miŋ kɛ yik iyah min, izhin bɛ nek tu ne ben Arik. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Duŋ yar akpa amin abɛ zǝ Arik ne kiki ndi izhin yime neyi ba. Izhin bǝ na ta acɛn.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Izhin bǝ ben Arik te bǝ nek anu adidik netu abɛ sak zhin iyah te kǝr izhin bǝ gbar ba Arik ba. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Izhin bǝ nyɛr ben abɛ nyɛr; izhin bǝ na zhin ben abɛ na zhin. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Izhin bǝ wɔb isɔŋ didik ne akpa amin. Kǝr inuŋ abɛdi iwa alǝk tu ba, ama abɛyi ner ne zitu zhɔk ne ndum kɛ nǝgu. Kǝr abɛdi iwa ayi ne Mgbemgbeb ba.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Duŋ di u na waŋ ndi ne nau ki mimin, iki mimin ba. Ubǝ te zee nena ki iyik ayi tedi u na kɔte ŋɔwa iki yi rɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Ate yi ndi itei te, ndi ite teu ubǝ na ki yiŋ ndi unai te wɔb sɔŋ kɛ sik susun ben aneshir bɔbɔk. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Duŋ di u na iki mimin ndi ne nau neyi ba, akpa amuŋ, ama ubǝ duŋ mfu kɛ Arik ilɛ mɛ. Ilɛ kɛ Arik idi, &lt;&lt;Arik adi, M tei na nau ma, M tei yau ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Neme, ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">&lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi abɛ te zor ami ikasa te ba, nek ba ikili;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">Ihrie te te ba, ne ba amashir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Nǝ na iyiŋɛ, utei duŋ ba awu ne ishisha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Kǝr ubǝ duŋ ishetan inaŋ susun mi ba, ama ubǝ naŋu ne susun kɛ naki didik.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Nek abɛ gli aneshir ngɔŋ men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Kɔ te ŋɔwa abɛ nek abɛ Gli aneshir ngɔŋ men, te Arik wa ne ŋyen ba ayak ne mben mǝne, ai Arik wa ne nek ba ngɔŋɔ. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Neme iwaŋ ndi ate kyak nek ba ngɔŋ men ne kyak iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nai; waŋ ndi a te na amɛ atei gbaŋ ambuk aku tu ma. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Abɛ Gli aneshir ba yi abɛ te sisik ben abaŋ ndi ana ki didik ba, ama ayi ki yi te sisik ben abaŋ ndi ana kiki mimin. Uwɔb te kǝr sisik bǝ teu ben abɛ Gli aneshir kai? Neme na ki didik, atei gbaru asak, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />te ayi agɛn abɛ Arik ubǝ na ndum didik kɛ tu mi. Ama zhin te na zumimin, izhin bǝ te sǝsǝk men te ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ kpa zhin. Ayi agɛn abɛ Arik agli ambuk Arik ayiŋ ndi atei te abɛ zumimin. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Nǝ ki yiŋɛ tsi kli te nek abɛ Gli aneshir ngɔŋ men, ba zhin te klu sak iyah yi Arik ba, ama bǝ yi ne asusun min.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi duŋ zhin ya gandu, te abɛ gli aneshir a na Arik wa ndum ndi awɔb te ba bɛ na ndum anenen. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Nek ba, iki yiŋ ndi azu ane yi; nek ba gandu mi, tsar ba zi tu zhɔk mi bǝn nek ba ngɔŋ men.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabǝ tɔ akpa mɔr shak ayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Izhin bǝ duŋ baŋ hru kɛ nuŋ sak ne tu min ba ihru keŋ ndi zhin baŋ kɛ izhin bǝ nyɛr akpa min. Waŋ ndi ate na me ne zǝ ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak Arik. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ikiki yi zǝ, &lt;&lt;Kǝr ubǝ duŋ zǝ amba ba, duŋ ŋun neshir ba, duŋ zhib ba, duŋ su ayi ne iki yi nuŋ ba,&gt;&gt; iki kikime ne biŋǝ ne nkanlɛ yiŋɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyɛr ikpa mi ir keŋ ndi unyɛr kpa mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Ate yiŋ ndi unyɛr inuŋ, bau te nau zumimin ba; nyɛr, ayi zǝ lɛ kɛ kpa nyak.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Nǝ rɛ te izhin bǝ na me, izhin ne zhi te mkpaŋ ne nyɛ ndi zhin te lu kli ne kurna min. Tǝ mkpaŋ kɛ lieru ne te gbahir azizaŋa tabǝ kuti tanyɛme. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Ibu neka te, iber tak nyɛ ŋan te amkpa alaŋ, tabǝ bǝ duŋ kiki yi bu, ta bǝ vu kiki yi te ikum ne laŋ amkpa. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Ta bǝ Gli akpa mɔr igligli didik, ndi aneshir abɛ tsǝn ne laŋ amkpa, ba baŋ ndi ana ki yi shisha, ben ahwa, ikin irik, ankiŋki, kǝr ta bɛ kyak akpa yi ba. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Ama zhin bǝ vu kiki iyi tyak ikum yi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ kristi, te duŋ shur ayi ne kiki mimin yi na min ba.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Duŋ te inuŋ ambuk ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Te abaŋ ndi itanyɛme men ba klik ba, ama bǝ ne duŋ te antam ben abɛba ne ki yi na men ba. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Aneshire anuŋ itanyɛme men duŋ ba li kiki bɔbɔk, ama inuŋ waŋ ndi itanyɛme maa ba klik ba ali amgbaki ayi lɛmbu. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Iwaŋ ndi alime abɛ duŋ tɔ ne yaŋ lime iyaŋ shak yi ba; ine yaŋ lime maayi abɛ duŋ te ne lime ambuk ba; Arik ne ta iner waŋa. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Iwa uyi ŋɔwa ndi utei yik lalɛ yi gen ayou nuŋ? Ayi atukɔ amen wa atei tɔ ka ne na didik ka ne zhaku. Ankyak ate lieru Arik atei duŋ ba lieru. <verse eid="ROM 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Aner anuŋ agbar bɛr naŋ iki iyi bǝn, anuŋ ayik ibɛre yi anenen kɔte ŋɔ abɛ mtanyeme ne susun maa. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Abaŋ ndi ne nyak susun men ne bɛr nuŋ abena te nek Arik ŋgɔŋ; abaŋ ndi ali kiki bɔbɔk abɛ na me te nek Arik ŋgɔŋ, abɛ nyɛr Arik ne ki li. Abaŋ ndi ne kyak kiki yiŋɛ abɛ na me te nek Arik ŋgɔŋ, te na nyɛr Arik. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Bata kusɔŋ isɔŋ kɛ atu amɔr ba, fe bata ku iku kɛ atu amɔr ankyak ba. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Ta te vli, ta sɔŋsɔŋ kɛ Arik, ta te ku, ta ku, ne atu yi zǝ Arik. Fe ate yiŋ ndi ivli kɔ ku,ta yi abɛ Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Tǝ kristi ne ku te lu tsǝtser te wa abɛ yi Ŋgɔŋ ne abɛ vli ben abɛ ku. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Izhineba, abɛ li amgbaki anii duŋ zhin te anuŋ ambuk? Fe izhineba abɛ li kiki bɔbɔk ayi anii duŋ zhin mla ben abɛ ta nyɛmei? Bɔbɔk mɔrɔ ta tei klɛ ne ti kɛ Arik te bɛ te ta ŋas. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Fe icɛr ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;&lt;Nǝ zhi te Ŋgam yi Arik tsetser, Ŋgɔŋ adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">Kɔte ŋɔwa atei tar agbarum ne ti muŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">Fe kɔte ŋɔwa atei di Ŋgam yi Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Kɔ te ŋɔwa ne miŋ mɔr, atei, bla kiki yiŋ ndi iwa ne nai ne ti kɛ Arik.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝr ubǝ duŋ nuŋ a zhaku ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ne me, kǝr ta bǝ duŋ te akpa mɔr ambuk ba. Ite yi amɛ, ta bǝ duŋ wɔb ankɔŋ ane duŋ nuŋ azhaku ba. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Ibiŋ tu muŋ ben Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ iduŋ mzhi te ndi kili nuŋ iyi ne rik; ama izhin te tanyɛme te kili nuŋ iyi ne rik; fe ina yi ne rik bene abɔu. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ate yiŋ ndi cɔk susun kɛ anuŋ la ne ki ndi uli, fe bɔu na yi ne miŋ kɛ tanyɛme ba. Kǝr ubǝ duŋ kili yiŋ ndi uli ibǝ duŋ kpa kɛ waŋ ndi kristi ne ku ne tu ma sik ba! <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />kǝr ubǝ uduŋ iki yiŋ ndi uyigǝ tedi ire bǝ ka ta sak mimin ba. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Fe ikɔb Arik bai kɛ li ben iso ba, ama iyi kɛ tsetser ben sik susun, ndi zhu yi Arik inǝk kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Fena ate yi ndi uzǝ kristi ne ankɔŋ awaŋa, ne sik Arik susun tena tanyɛme ben anuŋ.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Fena, ta bǝ nyak asusun amɔr ne kiki yiŋ ndi inǝk sik susun ndi na nek akpa mgbyamgbyaŋ. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Duŋ zhin, ne tu lɛ kɛ kili, te tyak iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nai ahrie ahria. atei ya li kili bɔbɔk, ama ba rɛ te tabǝ li ki yiŋ ndi itei duŋ nuŋ azhaku ne lalɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ki yiŋ ndi ne rɛ te bǝ na duŋǝ ita na, iso ayi, te na kiki yiŋ ndi itei duŋ nuŋ ne tanyɛme azhaku. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Nyak ki yiŋ ndi une tanyɛme neyi ne susun mi, fe, uwa ben Arik ami. Nyɛr iyi abaŋ ndi ba rǝ kpa ndi ate te ba ambuk ire! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ama ate yi ndi susun mǝne ikyak ne tanyɛme. ki yiŋ ndi une li, ubǝ zhi te uneka lalɛ ne min susun mi ba ne te anenen ne tanyɛme min ba. Tǝ iki yiŋ ndi ba yi ne miŋ kɛ tanyɛme ba ai lalɛ.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Ubǝ duŋ asusun aneshir amen ba mi ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Taba abaŋ ndi ta klik ne tanyɛme yi susun ta bǝ lɔk abaŋ ndi ba klik ba ne hru men. kǝr ta bɛ nyɛr atu mɔr ba. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Neme, ta bǝ duŋ asusun aneshir abɛ zǝ Yesɔ amen ne na ikiki didik men, te duŋ ba abɛ flu ne tanyɛme yi susun men. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Tǝ Kristi ba nyɛr tu maa ba. Neme, ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di, &lt;&lt;Iyen yiŋ ndi ne yi tu mi ne kam nyak ne atu muŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />kɔte cɛr ilɛ Arik tayi ne cɛrǝ te abɛ tsar ta, tǝ ta bǝ shur ayi ne vuŋ susun ben vuŋ kpa Gli ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik ne bla ta.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Arik ne nek vuŋ susun ben vuŋ kpa Gli, abɛ duŋ zhin sɔŋ keke ne akpa min ne zǝ nkɔŋ kɛ Kristi Yesɔ, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />te bɔbɔk mine izhin bǝ gbar Arik ben Tetɛɛ amɔr Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi asak ne ikɔr zhiin.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilɛ kɛ men ne tu abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Izhin bɛ ta akpa, ne nek Arik ŋgɔŋ, ir keŋ ndi Kristi ne ta zhin. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Fe mbla zhin te Kristi neyi igen ane Yahudawa, te abɛ tsar ina zub yi Arik, te abɛ duŋ ilɛ keŋ ndi ne kpa kɛ aŋyak antsintsim amen ibǝ shaga, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />te na duŋ abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba abɛ gbar Arik asak ne lɔ susun maa. Ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">&lt;&lt;Ne amɛ M tei gbaru asak ne miŋ abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">M tei nduk asem te mgbaru asak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Neme adi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">&lt;&lt;Izhin abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba izhin bǝ nyɛr ben aneshir abɛ Arik!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Fe izhin, ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba izhin bǝ gbar Arik asak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">Bɔbɔk aneshir abɛ gbar Arik asak!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Ankyak, Ishaya ne di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">&lt;&lt;Inuŋ ne nga kɛ Yese atei munɔru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Atei nyɛ te nyɛ gli abaŋ ndi bai Yahudawa ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">A tei na nyak asusun men bene bɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Arik waŋ, ndi ayi nkɔŋ kɛ nyak susun, ndi ne shaga ne mlak nyɛr ben sik susun ne miŋ kɛ tanyɛme min bene abɔu te nyak susun min bǝ flu ne zhu tsetser.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne cɛr mplɛ kǝŋe ne zhɔk susun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Amunyamɔr bǝn ane avamɔr: Nga ne tu muŋ mǝne zhi shaga ne na kiki didik, zhin nayi ne ankɔŋ azhi, ndi zhin te na tsara anuŋ. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Ama ne miŋ kɛ cɛr yiŋ ndi mǝne cɛr zhine me ne cɛr tem nek zhin mgbyamgbyaŋ. mne yine mgbyamgbyaŋ ne kpaŋ keŋ ndi Arik ne nǝm ne kǝ <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />tem yi gen ayou Kristi Yesɔ tem na abaŋ ndi ba yi Yahudawa ndum. Mne na ndi ne du lɛ didik kɛ men kɛ rɛ bǝn Arik, bǝn abaŋ ndi ba yi Yahudawa ba abɛ yi ki yi nek tena ta bǝn Arik, tena yi ki yi ŋla ne zhu tsetser. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Nǝ bine tu ben kristi Yesɔ, fe, M tei na ŋur asa ne min kɛ na ndum Arik. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />M tei ŋur asa te lɛ ankyak ndi Arik nenai ne aŋɔgɔ muŋ ne duŋ abaŋ ndi ba yi Yahudawa ba ne tanyɛme ben Arik. Nena amɛ ne nkanlɛ maa, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />Nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ kiki yi vuŋ anu maa, ne mgbamgbaŋ kɛ Izhu yi Arik. ne tsin kɛ rɛ Urshelima kɔmɔ bǝn ntuntun yi kam zǝk,mne bla lɛ kɛ men ne tu yi kristi. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Inyak susun muŋ kɔte kpaŋ takɛ yi ne bla lɛ kɛ men ne amkpa awaŋ ndi ba ne zen wɔ lɛ kɛ kristi ba,te kǝr mbǝ me ne tanda kɛ nuŋ ba. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Ir keŋ ndi cɛr ne bla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">&lt;&lt;Abaŋ ndi ba ne zǝne bla ba ne tu ma ba abɛ yik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">Abaŋ ndi ba ne wɔ ba atei wɔ te zhi.<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne akpa aŋyak iyi yir ntun Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Mne wɔb tem nyɛ ben abɛ zhin ama bam yik mkpaŋ ba. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Ama azizaŋa mne ka na ndum muŋ ŋklɛ ne gar kǝŋe ne baŋa ase tetɛk me zen wɔb tem yik zhin, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Mne nyak na me azizaŋa. Mǝ wɔb tem yik zhin ndi mte ngar kɔmɔ ne Asibaniya, izhin bǝ kum goŋ te ta bǝ gara amɔ ndi me te wɔ men kɛ yi ben abɛ zhin. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Ama azizaŋa, kɔ ne ankɔŋɔ atawa, M tei kɔmɔ ne Urshelima te me kɔ te na Arik ndum ne miŋ kɛ aneshire maa. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Fe aneshir abɛ Arik ne Makidɔniya ben Akaya ne wɔ men te nek tu men ben kiki men te abɛ nek aneshir abɛ iyah abe zǝ Arik ne Urushelima. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Ne wɔ men kɛ na me; ama lɛ didik, ne yi ne susun kɛ nek ba kinuŋ, tun ndi Yahudawa ne bine tu ben abaŋ ndi ba yi Yahudawa ba. Abaŋ ndi ba yi Yahudawa ba ne na gab kiki men ben Yahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ndi mte na ndum klɛ te kam kɔmɔ ne tu men azɔb ayiŋ ndi ne biŋ ba ne yi, M tei na ndum te gar ben abɛ ba. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />M tei kam nyɛ bǝn abɛ zhin, me ne zhi me tei nyɛ nyɛr ne anu didik kɛ kristi.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Mben zhin, akpa amuŋ, rɛ ben Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi ne nyɛr yiŋ ndi Iju tsetser nek, izhin bǝ lak me ben Arik ge. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ben me zhin Arik te li ru ben abaŋ ndi bane zhi Arik ba ne Yahudiya ndum muŋ ne Urushelima bǝ yik ta ben aneshir bɛ Arik amɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Ankyak M tei nyɛ ben abɛ zhin ne nyɛr, ndi Arik ate tanyɛme, ta te na nyɛr bɔbɔk mɔrɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Arik waŋ ndi a yi nek sik susun, abɛ zi ben abɛ zhin. bǝ yi amɛ.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Itek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Myi ne iki didik yi blaa zhin ne atu yi Fibi iva mɔr, iwaŋ ndi ana ndum ben abɛ zǝ Arik ne Kankiriya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mben te izhin bǝ tau ne sak kɛ Arik, ir keŋ ndi aneshir abɛ Arik ana, izhin bǝ na nǝgu iki yiŋ ndi awɔbǝ ben abɛ zhin; te iwa tu maa ayi kpa didik ben aneshir tetɛk te vuŋ nga muŋ yi.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Mtǝk Bilkisu ben Akila, akpa muŋ abɛ na ndum kɛ Kristi Yesɔ; <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />ne nek asusun amen ne atu muŋ. Mne nyɛr ba, bai nga ankyak ba, ama bɔbɔk aner abɛ zǝ Arik abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Izhin bɛ na tek abɛ zǝ Arik ndi abiŋ ne kɔmen ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Mna ntǝk ikpa amuŋ Abenita, uwaŋ ndi wa neyi ine kuti ta Kristi ne ntun yi Asiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Izhin bɛ na tek me Meryamu, waŋ ndi ne naa zhin ndum ngɔŋ. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Izhin bǝ tek Andaranikas bǝn Yuniyas, amunzumɔr, akpa muŋ ndi ayi Yahudawa ndi ne kuta ne jaru ndɔndɔ, abaŋ ndi ne zhi ba ngɔŋ ne miŋ kɛ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin, ndi ne kuumti ata Yesɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Izhin bǝ tek me Amfiliyas, iwaŋ ndi ayi ikpa muŋ ne miŋ kɛ zǝ Arik. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Mna tek Urbanas, ikpa mɔr ne na nduŋ Kristi, ben ikpa ne nyɛr amuŋ Istakis. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Izhin bɛ na tek me Abalis, ndi Kristi neka tanyɛme bene bɔu. Izhin bɛ na tek me aner abɛ kɔb Aristɔbulus. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Mna tek Hirudiyan ikpa mɔr waŋ ndi ayi awɔnǝ Yahudawa, ben abɛ zǝ Kristi ndi ayi ne kɔb Narkisas.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Mna tek Tarafina bǝn Tarafusa, abaŋ ndi ne na ndum kɛ Arik, Izhin bɛ na tek me Barsisa ndi ayi kpa amuŋ, waŋ ndi ne na ndum kɛ Arik ngɔŋ. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Mtǝk Rufus, ine na ndum kɛ Arik ndi ne hriau, ben iyah maa, waŋ ndi kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ ne glim ndi zu maa. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Izhin bǝ tek me Asinkiritas, ben Filiguma, bǝn Hamasa, bǝn Baturobas, Bǝn Hamasa, bǝn nki amunya abɛ zǝ Kristi ndi ayi bǝn abɛba. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Izhin bǝ na tǝk Filulugusa, bǝn Yuliya, bǝn Niriya, bǝn va men, bǝn Ulufas bǝn abɛ zǝ Arik bɔbɔk ndi ayi bǝn abɛba. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Izhin bɛ tek akpa ne ku asa ne sik susun. Aneshir bɔbɔk abɛ zǝ Arik atǝk zhin.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inǝk ilɛ kɛ klɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Mben zhin, amunya: Izhin bǝ hria ayi te abaŋ ndi aŋar aneshir te na shur aneshir iki yi duŋ ba zhaku ne tanyɛme yi susun men te duŋ ba duŋ zǝ ilɛ keŋ ndi ne tsar ba ne kɛ. Izhin bǝ te shaan ben abɛba! <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Tǝ abaŋ ndi ana iki yiŋɛ ba zǝ Kristi Arik amɔr ba, amaa azǝ ine men. Acɔk aneshir abaŋ ndi ba ne zhi ikinuŋ ba ne lǝlɛ yi rɛ wɔ ben imen kɛ anu amen. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />kɔte ŋɔwa ne wɔ ilɛ kɛ vuŋ kpa min miŋ kɛ ne zǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik, neme mnyɛr zhin. Ama mwɔb te izhin bǝ yi abɛ mgbemgbebɛ ne iki didik, te te zhin shaan ne iki yiŋ ndi iyi mimin. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Ankyak Arik waŋ ndi iwa ayi ne nek sik susun, atei caŋ ishetan ne aza min.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Iki didik yi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ amɔr bɛ yi ben abɛ zhin.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoti, ikpa ne na ndum amɔr atǝk zhin; te ben Lukiyas, Yason, ben Susibataras, akpa mɔr Yahudawa.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nga, Tartiyas, waŋ ndi ne cɛr mplɛ kǝŋe, mtǝk zhin abɛ zǝ Kristi.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayus iwaŋ ndi ne tam, ne kɔb keŋ ndi abɛ zǝ Kristi abiŋe, atǝk zhin; Arastas, ine nyak azɔb ayi ntun, ben izumɔr Kawartas atǝk zhin.<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Iki didik yi Arik Yesɔ Kristi bǝ yi ben abɛ zhin bɔbɔk. Ibǝ yi amɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iben ben gbar asak ayi klɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Ta bǝ nek Arik ŋgɔŋ maa! Uwa ne duŋ zhin klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ne tanyɛme yi susun min, ne ki didik yiŋ ndi mne du ne kɛ ne atu ayi Yesɔ Kristi ben iki yi zub yi suyir ndi nɛ bui aglɛ rumɔ ndi ne sui ayir ire ase yi kukub ayi gayir. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Azizaŋa, ndi, izub yiŋɛ nɛ men aglii arumɔ ne cɛr yi abɛ bla shar yi Arik; ankyak ne nek ilɛ kɛ Arik ne yaŋ klɛtu ne duŋ aneshir bɔbɔk abɛ zhi, te abɛ tanyɛme te na zǝ kɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Igar ben Arik Ŋgɔŋ kiki maa, Uwa ndi mgbemgbebɛ bɔbɔk iyi maa ankyak, bǝ inǝk ŋgɔŋ bǝ zǝ ben Yesɔ Kristi iyaŋ klɛtu! Bǝ yi amɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>